[36m(TaskRunner pid=420675)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=420675)[0m The powers of 3 that are divisors of \(362880\) are \(3^0 = 1\) and \(3^4 = 81\). 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=420675)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=420675)[0m Summing these, we get:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=420675)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=420675)[0m 1 + 81 = 82
[36m(TaskRunner pid=420675)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=420675)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=420675)[0m Thus, the sum of the positive divisors of \(9!\) that have a units digit of 1 is \(\boxed{82}\).
